{"answer_text":"Use one pipeline per sales motion (new business, expansion, partners), share stage definitions, and report across all of them. Tools that handle multiple pipelines well: [1]\n\n- **Pipewell Flow**: The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box. [2]\n- **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**: Mature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting. [3]\n- **Orbitly**: Can model a pipeline as a board, but has no forecasting. [4]\n- **Sheetly**: Fine for a handful of deals, not for a real pipeline. [5]\n\nIn short, pick Pipewell for breadth, or Northwind CRM if you want something your reps will adopt faster.\n\nLedgerline's 2026 roundup ranks most of these near the top as well.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ca-702d-87bc-0a28d5f65287","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:59.850Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm multiple pipelines reporting","track deals multiple pipelines crm","multiple sales pipelines best practice"],"latency_ms":4660,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[179,187],[560,568]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[288,301],[585,598]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":fal